  "findings": [
    "Both selected tops explicitly instantiate mtf_xyz_navigation_control with PROOF_CONTROLLER=1. That instance instantiates mtf_xyz_hold_control with CAL_MASK=0xff and does not override MAX_ANGLE. Its outputs feed the handoff and flight_core hold target mux; it is an active physical-control path, not unused comments.",
    "The selected horizontal hold-controller output cap changed from 1200 to 2500 cdeg. Both downstream core/rate angle clips allow 2500, so no hidden 1200 inner clip nullifies the change.",
    "B0AC actively computes captured relative-position error times POSITION_KP_Q16 in states 43..45 into a world-velocity target. B0B0 actively replaces those states with normalized-stick velocity and zeros world_sx/world_sy, entering velocity feedback directly. The explicit position outer loop was removed.",
    "Temporal checker and accepted-record guard are byte-identical across the selected versions. The pipeline comparison adds only the tilt4500 output connection. The complete estimator diff consists of that 45-degree publication-synchronous Boolean output, its combinational comparison and reset/publication assignments; estimator numeric recurrences are unchanged.",
    "The version difference does not establish the image used by an earlier unlogged successful self-stabilized flight or a unique cause of the later optical-flow failures."
  ],
